# Google Maps for the customer website's Map screen (optional).
# Create a SEPARATE key in Google Cloud for the browser: enable only "Maps JavaScript API" and restrict it to
# HTTP referrers (your site's origin, e.g. https://your-domain/*). Do NOT reuse the server's Routes key or the Android key.
# Without it the website falls back to its OpenStreetMap map.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY=
